# p_e9c1 — Both drive weekdays, cycle weekends; tablet at nightstand (fork of p_4e91)

This fork of p_4e91 corrects the single weakest element in the parent: the tablet. The parent placed tablet_omar at chair_k1 for the full 24 hours (with a "sometimes" kitchen_table_k1 block 7–13h). The sightings show the tablet at nightstand_b1 at 00:00 (2/3), 08:00 (2/3), and 16:00 (3/3), with the only chair_k1 sighting at 18:00. The tablet is a bedside device that stays in the bedroom until the evening, when the household gathers in the kitchen/living area and it moves to the kitchen chair.

